  ["ed2","H",5,"R","Read: « Je viens de finir mes examens. Si je réussis, j’irai à l’université ; sinon, je chercherai un emploi. » What will he do if he fails?",["look for a job","go to university","resit his exams","finish his exams"],"The word sinon means otherwise (if not), so if he does not pass he will look for a job."]
